00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:10.780
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.750
This time, I'm making a birthday cake for the children at Piyo Piyo Kindergarten.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:18.150
I promised the Ringo-chan who had just transferred here and couldn't mix with the group, a cake that will help her get along with everyone.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:16.780
closed captions

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:24.020
I designed the cake, then I practiced making it with the rest of the A-group over and over until it was fabulous.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:29.160
That's what I thought, but I had a shock when I saw a cake exactly like mine that B-group made!

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.340
We only have an hour left until the birthday party...

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.190
Ah! That's it! I got an even better design!

