00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.850
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.850
#Wasurenai@irc.rizon.net

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:13.460
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.560
Wait. Hold it right there.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:23.780
Hmmm...

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.540
That's terrible. How could you steal Amano-san's design?

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.380
That's a false accusation. Wasn't it Amano-san who copied ours?

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.690
No, she didn't.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:41.870
For my sister, Ringo's sake, I watched Amano-san painstakingly research and design it!

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.290
That is without a doubt Amano-san's design.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.020
Do you have proof?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.810
The proof that shows that we stole the design.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.120
Since you seem so sure. You have proof to back it up, don't you?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.830
Show me the proof.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.030
T-That is...

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.930
Unbelievable.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:05.410
Being suspicious of us without any proof indeed.
You're the one that's terrible.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.550
That's enough.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:11.710
Rumi-san.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:14.920
You guys sure made quite a terrible mess.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.470
What are you talking about?

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.420
You can feign ignorance all you want.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.630
But if it wasn't plagiarism, such an embarrassment wouldn't exist.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.360
You all fail as pâtissières.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.810
This has nothing to do with you right, Katou-san?

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:30.620
Of course it does.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:35.650
Kana-chan is my friend. I can't stand by and watch my friend get bullied.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.430
Let's go, Kana-chan.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:42.460
Humph!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:51.540
She's just a beginner with no real ability, and yet she's in the A-group. How impertinent.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:56.460
It's definitely impossible to remake a cake in just an hour.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.920
The one held responsible would be that girl who designed it, right?

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:04.400
Be completely embarrassed, Amano Ichigo.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:11.430
recipe 7

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:11.430
Buddies Birthday Cake

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.300
A better design?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.050
Yes. Let's modify the design.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.830
Modify? From now? What cake do you have in mind?

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:23.900
There's no time. I'll explain as we go along.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.820
Lend me a hand.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.260
Will she be fine?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.660
We have no choice but to believe in Amano-san.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:33.210
We'll just have to do it. There's no other way around.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:40.240
It's frustrating. Amano-san worked so hard for my sister's sake.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.960
Kana-chan.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.270
Look over there.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:49.530
Ichigo-chan and the rest have not given up at all.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:53.560
They're doing their best in making a cake for Ringo-chan.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.550
Amano-san.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.880
It's not over yet. I believe in Ichigo-chan and the rest. Let's wait for them, okay?

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.560
Yes.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.320
Now it's a fight against time.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:11.260
Andou-kun, please make lots of cookies with pastillage icing.

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:12.250
All right.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.640
Kashino, please ready the white chocolate cream.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.290
Yeah.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.490
Hanabusa-kun, please prepare the marzipan.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.240
Okay.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.670
I have to manage this somehow.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:28.520
Because I promised Ringo-chan a cake that will help her get along with everyone.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.870
I'll definitely make it on time.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:38.780
Stealing Ichigo's design at the very last minute, those girls are nasty, aren't they?

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.870
You're right. That's really unfair.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:44.640
You all move your hands and not your mouths. Use your hands!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.290
You're a hindrance, Caramel.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.560
Moreover, it's so obvious that she copied Amano.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.590
That's true.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:58.120
It must be due to her jealousy.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.080
That's because transfer students stand out.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.920
Thank you, everyone.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.090
I'm so happy that you believed me.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:09.840
Because, only you would think of making such a strange cake.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.090
Hey, hey...

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.930
S-Strange?

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.830
I don't mean it in a bad way.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.850
How do I put it, like that chocolate roll for example, Ichigo's cake...

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.610
...is able to tell a story.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.840
Story?

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:28.090
Your skill still needs much improvement, though.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:28.970
That's right.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.350
20 minutes left!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.210
Hey, we have all the ingredients ready!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:37.620
Yes. With these, it'll work!

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:42.160
Vanilla, Caramel, Cafe and Choco, I need your strength.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.130
Can you please help me out?

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:45.970
Yes!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.560
We'll be pleased to do what we can.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.130
What do you want us to do?

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.480
Wait for me, Ringo-chan.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.130
I'll definitely make you a cake you'll enjoy.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:02.990
Ayu-chan. We'll be getting birthday cakes today, right?

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:06.020
I wonder what cake we'll get. I'm so excited.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.140
It's worth looking forward to, isn't it?

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:10.320
It'll definitely be cuter than Ringo-chan's cake.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.690
Hey, apple cheeks.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:18.240
What kind of cake did you request from Strawberry panties?

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.170
Umm... Well...

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.160
We won't forgive you if it's horrible.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.730
Don't say such unnecessary things.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.880
What's wrong with you?

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.090
What happened to the A-group?

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:35.280
It seems that they are still in the cooking room.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.100
Eh? Still? Will they be fine?

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.520
I'm sure they'll be. Because Kashino-kun and the others are there, too.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.270
That's true.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:49.300
Sensei, isn't it time for your next class? You'll be late for it.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:53.020
Eh? That's true. Well, I'll leave the rest to you then.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:53.980
Yes.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:59.830
A-group will be going by taxi. So, please take off now.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.790
What terrible people.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:07.050
Now even if the cake is done, they won't make it there on time.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.540
K-Kana-chan.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.860
It's done!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.220
There's no time left. Let's hurry up!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.850
Amano. Hurry up!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.770
Hurry on without shaking the box!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.860
I know.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.360
Please wait up!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.370
Get into my pocket, Caramel.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.360
Phew, that sure helped.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.740
Eh, where's the bus?

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:43.370
Didn't they wait for us?

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.200
There's only one bus every hour though.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.290
We won't make it on time by bus. How about calling for a taxi?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.480
No, it would take 20 minutes before it'll arrive.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.900
How about asking a Sensei who drives?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:58.300
It'll take 30 minutes to get to the staff room and back.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:01.390
Why is the academy so big?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.220
Vanilla, can you do anything with your magic?

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:07.000
Like teleport to the kindergarten or something?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.900
S-Such magic is impossible.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.020
What do we do?

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.740
Amano-san!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.620
Koizumi-san?

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:23.580
Good afternoon!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.250
Eh, where is Strawberry panties?

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.160
They seem to be coming a bit late.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:58.200
But I was really surprised when a hitchhiker suddenly jumped out!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:09.470
I apologize for this abruptness, but could you please drive us from Yamato Fumoto to Piyo Piyo Kindergarten?

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.000
Eh?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:15.670
My sister is waiting, and my friends are trying their hardest. Please!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:20.390
Please! Please! Please...

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:25.720
I don't know the details, but it's obvious that she was frantic.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.930
I'm sorry.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.780
Oh no, it's already past noon.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.130
Could you please speed up?

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.870
Ah! Okay!

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.930
I'll drive there at the maximum speed limit!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.150
It's going to shake a little, hang on tight!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:41.700
Be careful.

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:44.310
Ahh...

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.680
Be careful. What happens if you smash the cake? Idiot!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.640
I know! You didn't have to say it like that.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.880
Protect the cake!

00:10:58.140 --> 00:10:59.880
The birthday party isn't starting yet?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.610
I'm hungry.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:08.060
This is worrying. Is Ringo-chan's cake not here yet?

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:13.610
Let us present our cake first. Meanwhile, the other cake might just arrive.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:18.320
That's right. Please begin then.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:24.360
This month, our friends celebrating their birthdays are Ayu-chan and Ringo-chan.

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.730
One, Two.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:29.580
Happy Birthday!!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.380
Thank you!

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:39.300
Well then, first it's Ayu-chan's birthday on the 4th. Let's see her cake!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.640
Happy Birthday, Ayu-chan.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.670
It's a snowy day at the kindergarten.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:49.680
Amazing!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.540
Look! Ayu is here too.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.320
This is great.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.290
Wow, Mii-chan is here too.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.410
Our cake isn't here yet?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.470
What's happened to it?

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.610
Did you ask her properly?

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.410
Thank you for waiting!

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.420
Aren't you late? We thought you weren't coming already.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.940
You...

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:21.950
Hurry up and bring out Ringo-chan's cake, Amano-san.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.430
Everyone's waiting.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.520
Ringo-chan. Sorry for making you wait.

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:40.020
Even with the sweets princes, there's no way they can change it in just an hour.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:44.070
Just present the same cake and feel embarrassed, Amano Ichigo.

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:51.580
The cake we made just for Ringo-chan will definitely please her!

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.460
Happy Birthday, Ringo-chan!

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.360
This is Ringo-chan in the witch's house.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.350
Amazing!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.270
A candy house!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.790
We want to see it too.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:22.770
Me too.

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:28.830
No way. Why? There shouldn't have
been enough time to remake it though!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:32.850
They added more marzipan designs to the base of the cake.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:38.370
With additional cookies and chocolates, they made a candy house.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.570
Did that girl think that up?

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:46.050
Everyone, Ringo-chan is trapped in the witch's house.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.210
There really is a witch there.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.100
Ringo-chan's in trouble.

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:56.600
With the response power of the apple tree, you can save her from the witch. Please save Ringo-chan!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.450
That's easy!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.580
You're overdoing it, Cafe.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.600
An enthusiastic performance.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.640
S-Scary!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.400
It's just ventriloquism.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.080
See?

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.060
Geez, you sure scared us.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.680
I want to drop one in too.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.840
Let go of Ringo-chan!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.610
Hey, it seems that the witch is beaten!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.710
Well everyone, let's go inside then.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.070
Quick!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.300
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.790
Hey, not there!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.060
Are you ready? One, two!

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:02.170
What! Ringo-chan baked a cake and she's waiting for us!

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.450
Wow! Amazing!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:06.750
It's like magic!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.150
No way!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.760
How did that happen?

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:13.440
Phew, that was a close call, huh?

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.350
You better treat us to cookies, Ichigo.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.150
Ringo-chan. Thank everyone who beat the witch.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:33.570
T-T-Thank you, everyone.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.080
What's with that formal address?

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.270
Whose rich little girl are you?

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:42.840
Ringo-chan's interesting.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:57.060
Err, say, can we put this next to Ayu-chan's cake and play together?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.540
I'm Ringo. Pleased to meet you, Ayu-chan.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:11.780
Pleased to meet you, too.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.620
Ringo-chan herself made...

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:21.520
Thanks to the cake, they're so close.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:26.190
Ichigo-chan planned this far with that design.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.620
I was wondering how it would turn out, but it went well, didn't it?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.820
All's well that end's well.

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:36.050
It's not over yet. We still have to report to the Queen.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.510
That's right.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.780
My, such fragrant apples.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:02.870
To increase it's fragrance, we mixed apple mousse and julienned apples together.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.340
Delicious!

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.500
Apple cakes are good too.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.720
How is it, Ringo-chan?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:17.090
Err, you know, it's completely different from the cake the Sensei from Aomori made.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.300
But it's just as delicious.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.310
I'm glad.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:24.060
Everyone look, this is Ayu!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:26.570
It's definitely delicious because everyone is eating it together.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.620
Who is this?

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.310
This one is Ringo-chan.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.430
Amano-san!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.730
What's wrong, Koizumi-san?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.130
It's the first time I've seen my sister smile since we got here.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.820
It's thanks to you, Amano-san. Thank you so much!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:47.000
Don't, I didn't do this alone. Moreover, it's thanks to Rumi-san and Koizumi-san that we made it in time.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.330
Amano-san...

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:52.710
Stop being so formal, you two.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:57.510
Today onwards we're buddies. Just call each other Ichigo-chan and Kana-chan, alright?

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:02.060
That's right. I'll be in your care from now, Ichigo-chan.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.060
Same here, Kana-chan.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.470
There are so much here, please help yourselves too.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:09.750
I've been waiting.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.750
So, Itadakimasu.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.860
That's...

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.890
...the cake that B-group made.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.530
Do you want some, Strawberry panties?

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:22.860
Yeah.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.670
It's really juicy.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:31.520
The sponge and apple blends well together.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:36.830
Apple is mixed in lots of custard cream, leaving a really great feeling.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:48.590
They can make such a delicious cake and yet, why did they do that?

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:50.120
Umm...

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:52.440
Ringo-chan.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:58.900
You know, when I asked for the candy dolls, everyone gave them to me.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.810
Wow, that's great, isn't it?

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:02.270
Where's your doll?

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.270
I exchanged it with Ayu-chan.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:05.410
I see.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:10.410
In order to bring it back home, wrap it in a napkin, okay?

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:14.440
Hmm?

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:18.920
I love your cake, Onee-chan!

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.930
Ringo-chan must be really happy.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:30.430
Amano...

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.580
W-What's wrong?

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.590
It's the first time I realize this...

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:36.480
Huh?

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.530
I never knew it.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:47.050
There's so much joy in bringing others happiness with the sweets you make.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:56.000
Grandma... she always smiled when I ate her cakes and said it was delicious.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:59.240
Was my grandma this happy as well?

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:03.520
To be able to feel such happiness.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.050
Sweets are amazing!

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:16.400
Thank you everyone. Sweets Spirits, thank you for your hard work too.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.350
You're welcome.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.870
That was so much fun.

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:21.240
It was very thrilling.

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.930
It's so tiring.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.200
That's right.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:27.220
I can't wait to make sweets again.

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.740
Ah, who are we having self-practice with today?

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.030
That's right.

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:33.850
I'll get back first and start on the preparations.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.030
Let's go, Vanilla.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:35.840
Yeah!

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.220
She's on seventh heaven.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.580
It's her first time receiving others happiness, right?

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.340
It's natural that she's happy.

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:45.930
What's wrong, Hanabusa?

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:50.770
Nothing. Just that it's interesting how well Ichigo-chan grasps things.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:55.580
She instinctively knows what others seek.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.850
With this and her skills improved...

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.270
Are you afraid?

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:01.780
Not at all.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.420
I'm looking forward to it.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:07.280
From now on, what kind of sweets will Ichigo-chan make?

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:12.250
Grandma, I want to make more and more delicious sweets.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:16.290
And with those sweets, I want to make people smile.

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:18.980
So, I'll do my best!

